    "customize": [
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 1,
        "text": "过场动画与预告",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "《原神》雷电将军角色PV——「噩梦」"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/02/09/326985891/9c40bf16db74f8ccd7077f24c8922576_6786970550732811181.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>2021年8月26日</color>\n昔日流影，只存虚梦。天下人心，寂入恒常。\n此为狩眼仪式当日，「一心净土」之内的残留影像。\n<color=#ff9999>YouTube:</color>"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomVideo",
        "url": "https:/www.youtube.com/watch?v=HoqLRiXIpqA"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "《原神》剧情PV-「许以臣民之梦」"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/07/08/237301566/1f159e980b5d40b7465e9e4f35b01226_6227974729071884020.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>2021年9月6日</color>\n全力奔跑的国度，已成须臾之影。也许唯有定格此刻，才可永存稻光…\n以「无想」肃清稻妻前进的阻碍，以「永恒」许以臣民浮世的美梦。\n此为鸣神国土之上，「雷电将军」的常道一心。\n<color=#ff9999>YouTube:</color>"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomVideo",
        "url": "https:/www.youtube.com/watch?v=r5LRouO9sjM"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "《原神》荒泷一斗角色PV——「就该这么演！」"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/02/09/326985891/4848279596b8bcf6d3618e905d983f85_1711956931534988704.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>2021年12月8日</color>\n在有荒泷派介入的时候，哪怕是再传统的剧目，也可能迎来新的转折。\n虽然这种惊喜受到了部分观众的喜爱，但给天领奉行带来了不少麻烦。\n看看这次，究竟是荒泷一斗的笑声更长，还是维护治安的官兵更快吧。\n<color=#ff9999>YouTube:</color>"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomVideo",
        "url": "https:/www.youtube.com/watch?v=iu096jrwfiI"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "《原神》八重神子角色PV—「狐之所爱」"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/02/09/326985891/93079c2fab190d80631973c5c174f00e_2231211354646473308.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>2022年2月10日</color>\n鸣神大社的宫司大人心中有很多喜爱之物。\n奇思妙想的小说，香嫩多汁的油豆腐，还有趣味横生的人们…\n如此种种，只要是能避免无聊的东西，她都很喜欢。\n所幸，这些都可以在「人间」寻得。\n<color=#ff9999>YouTube:</color>"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomVideo",
        "url": "https:/www.youtube.com/watch?v=jXTo3G7_310"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "《原神》3.3版本PV：「六入尽明，诸相皆无」"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/03/10/237301566/c6fa66810399b209da492e4c6507fd7e_2232675549275121279.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>2022年11月25日</color>\n稻妻自古以来就不缺少怪谈传说。\n有些自然与世代传承的鬼怪大妖脱不了干系；\n而有些，也许只是旧时遗事的苍凉一角…\n<color=#ff9999>YouTube:</color>"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomVideo",
        "url": "https:/www.youtube.com/watch?v=zww0Uke61o0"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "《原神》剧情PV-「秋津羽戏」"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/07/08/237301566/1a06aee47a8ce07dedb1cad8d2715c48_6666232205818230313.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>2022年12月19日</color>\n简单来说，以羽子板击球打靶，考验速度、耐性与方向控制力，即为「秋津羽戏」。\n此番游艺可以单人玩耍，但若想合作或比试，可要找个默契的同伴才能尽兴。\n<color=#ff9999>YouTube:</color>"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomVideo",
        "url": "https:/www.youtube.com/watch?v=_gW1RMvJ2Vc"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "《原神》5.4版本PV：「梦间见月明」"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/01/27/70239714/8a8149bd9cfe859a61ce13ad03422c8e_3560298213814227112.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>2025年1月24日</color>\n人生就像穿梭在美梦与噩梦之间。\n感觉到紧张、恐惧、无法喘息的时刻，\n请稍作休息，品尝美梦的甘甜，\n并将噩梦揉碎咀嚼。\n<color=#ff9999>YouTube:</color>"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomVideo",
        "url": "https:/www.youtube.com/watch?v=3sUp4uPMJzg"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "《原神》梦见月瑞希角色PV——「心中梦中盘中餐」"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/02/10/70239714/a32791c588347b8596000aabbabf72cc_7857974297832988996.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>2025年2月6日</color>\n食梦貘以梦为食。\n当餐叉落下，她将一层一层，刺入你穿过的暗门、触过的荆棘、迎过的风浪。\n直至找到最柔软的那处「美味」，将它呈至你的面前。\n<color=#ff9999>YouTube:</color>"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomVideo",
        "url": "https:/www.youtube.com/watch?v=-rjucJ_CqNY"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "《原神》角色预告-「梦见月瑞希：心慌帮！帮心慌！」"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/01/24/326985891/ae3ad3b437ba1f1c8333ca15083dc1b6_1494664285155802951.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>2025年2月11日</color>\n「心慌帮！帮心慌！——稻妻妖怪们最为挚爱的综艺节目，好评开演！\n「由游学归来、博闻多才的美女心理诊疗师梦见月小姐，帮助你解决最棘手的烦恼！\n「无论白天黑夜，在每个敞开心扉的梦境，与你相会！」\n<color=#ff9999>YouTube:</color>"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomVideo",
        "url": "https:/www.youtube.com/watch?v=60PACsnPoCE"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "《原神》过场动画-「千梦一夜」"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/02/09/326985891/28acfd55ea4dfaf40b4d0a8788b69779_2786177814514472350.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>2025年2月17日</color>\n美梦与噩梦皆有其源头。它们互相交错，让人在其中见到真正的自我。\n美梦与噩梦也可有其终点。食梦貘将痛苦吞噬，留下安宁与长夜作伴。\n<color=#ff9999>YouTube:</color>"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomVideo",
        "url": "https:/www.youtube.com/watch?v=VZHOOvqIZeU"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "《原神》剧情PV-「浮梦之诉」"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/02/09/326985891/d37bba1497a01fa2f5c4ff2ed77f06bc_7016151328971671139.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>2025年2月18日</color>\n浮生如一世一梦。\n梦中旧影徘徊，醒后余温尚在。\n<color=#ff9999>YouTube:</color>"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomVideo",
        "url": "https:/www.youtube.com/watch?v=n2BylizgV8U"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 1,
        "text": "展示页与表情包",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "《原神》派蒙的画作XII-表情包登场！"
