        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/02/27/237301566/29cfd3f03e1d2de4a10900ac4ae962bb_2988028257249300072.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>2022年12月28日</color>\n这里为旅行者准备了「百鬼戏话」网页活动插画壁纸，旅行者可以按照自己的需要保存使用哦~"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "《原神》「百鬼戏话」网页活动壁纸展示"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/02/27/237301566/a15dd0b643cd14c4e9e89798e9211aef_7084440701458562518.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>2022年12月28日</color>\n这里为旅行者准备了「百鬼戏话」网页活动插画壁纸，旅行者可以按照自己的需要保存使用哦~"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "《原神》「百鬼戏话」网页活动壁纸展示"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/02/27/237301566/74f6140120cad59757caa57cf5a3ebb0_3125787228327247046.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>2022年12月28日</color>\n这里为旅行者准备了「百鬼戏话」网页活动插画壁纸，旅行者可以按照自己的需要保存使用哦~"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "达达利亚，生日快乐！"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/02/27/237301566/9ce8f420b525206f9da29ac4af93fe69_7800182095981992297.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>2023年7月20日</color>\n「嗯？这画册…是我那四处旅行的伙伴送来的吧。\n「这么久没见，不知下次相遇又要等到什么时候…\n「…托克！快来哥哥这里，有好看的妖怪绘本哦。」\n「太好了！可以听哥哥讲故事了！独眼小宝也一起来听！」\n「啊哈哈…好，那就从头开始讲起——」"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "《原神》「螺音忆梦」壁纸展示"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/02/04/326985891/f850bc0106ea27f0cda5b73ab897c064_6085592378336203992.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>2023年7月31日</color>\n感谢旅行者的支持，派蒙为旅行者送上「螺音忆梦」OST活动专属壁纸。\n旅行者可以按照自己的需要保存使用哦~"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "《原神》「移光拾影」网页活动壁纸展示"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/01/29/326985891/5a4f879ed7c10338b38d5d2b43d44fac_6170886082148838800.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>2023年8月15日</color>\n旅行者们好呀，这里为大家带来了「移光拾影」网页活动的壁纸，旅行者可以按照自己的需要保存使用哦~\n旅行者们跟随派蒙，成功拍摄出所有的风物画片了吗？"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "枫原万叶，生日快乐！"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/02/05/326985891/aba5f8e9c79edcf1a25f16ce5d0b5836_8535911263515068790.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>2023年10月29日</color>\n「呵，今天是我的生日，我们很有缘呢。」"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "托马，生日快乐！"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/02/05/326985891/f08e8c68f8d260668daf34ef530f1336_6062214895130924851.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>2024年1月9日</color>\n「刚刚消失的狸猫…变成什么模样了呢？」"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "九条裟罗，生日快乐！"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/02/27/237301566/cefba3c0cc6c3f6fdb1b845f207e9f51_6144213322564030410.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>2024年7月14日</color>\n守护山林是天狗的职责，我和妖狸们也算是老相识了。\n它们特地来为我庆生，作为天狗可不能失了礼数。\n喏，新鲜的堇瓜，也分你一个吧。\n不用担心，我正好准备了五个，大家都有份。"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "久岐忍，生日快乐！"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/02/05/326985891/3da12cf96b8a758c1c8628eaaa7698d7_8675399729623742565.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>2024年7月27日</color>\n今天我们和这个小家伙一起出门？\n我没有宠物驯养证，或许我需要先去学习…\n啊，扑过来了——手感意外得不错呢，毛茸茸的。\n那就当作是考证前的练习吧。走，一起去花见坂散步好了。"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "梦见月瑞希-角色绘图"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/02/16/326985891/5621fa55a9caabc97b08e7a81576257a_2159279869863704870.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>2025年2月12日</color>\n「早安。昨天有做个好梦吗？」"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "梦见月瑞希，生日快乐！"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/02/05/326985891/0586761a6b6c7e0cdde94a0278398539_8587219511748517376.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>2025年3月16日</color>\n「呼~不错的清晨呢。那么，今天，做什么比较好呢？哦，风中还有悠可琴声？是流泉之众的朋友们也来稻妻旅游了吗？」"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "梦见月瑞希，生日快乐！"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/02/05/326985891/817186b736753b9e8b789b2f3ba36ee5_2544551277315112007.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>2025年3月16日</color>\n午安，看你的神情，刚刚一定做了个好梦吧？\n看样子诊疗的效果很不错呢。正好，午后甜点也准备好了。\n这是小安和小彻一起帮忙准备的特别款甜点，是其他店里买不到的味道哦。\n总之，还请全都好好吃完~"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "八重神子，生日快乐！"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/02/05/326985891/1a818d8cf95eeb4a5b624215dddc4021_8246978761964822714.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>2025年6月27日</color>\n哎呀呀，偷偷吃油豆腐被后辈发现了。\n能找到这来，鼻子很灵嘛，看来平日的修行没有懈怠呢。\n不过我也只有一份，怎么办呢，不如，你们去拦住做这份便当的人吧？\n相信那位旅者一定不忍心看你们饿肚子，也会给你们做一份大餐的~"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "鹿野院平藏，生日快乐！"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/02/05/326985891/36d67a484a1ba51653bed6a4a5dac0d6_5393330994349972320.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>2025年7月24日</color>\n奇怪，所有脚印都在此处中断，除非嫌犯能够化风而行，否则…谁在那里？！\n呼，原来是妖狸们。怎么了，找我有什么事吗？\n等等，诸位带来的这枚袋子有些眼熟，难道是从嫌犯身上掉落的？\n真是帮大忙了，等案件顺利解决，我一定带很多瓜果来感谢你们！"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "阿贝多，生日快乐！"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/02/07/326985891/7db07d88c5a66420645a3e436dbda9e9_8561256817734855697.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>2025年9月13日</color>\n「这本小说里的食梦貘，倒是有些意思。如果画出来…是这样吗？」"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "早柚，生日快乐！"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/02/05/326985891/81684357783d979a95280224139c7c50_2970597352909399005.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>2025年10月19日</color>\n等一下，这个声音是…不好，是巫女姐姐找过来了，得溜了。\n小妖狸，可以帮忙吸引注意力吗？变成我的样子躲在树上就行。\n只要能骗过拿着胡萝卜的巫女姐姐，我就把我的饭团分给你吃。\n可以的话，顺便把她拿着的胡萝卜都偷走吧。拜托你了！"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 1,
        "text": "其他社交绘图",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "2026年元旦节《原神》日本官方贺图"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/02/12/326985891/b4a6f017b7efbc29f73a2e2588b9af7a_857032376601310386.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>2026年1月1日</color>\n<color=#ffffff>「翻译自原文」</color>\n新年快乐！\n非常感谢您过去一年来对《原神》的支持！\n我们期待您今年继续支持我们！\n<color=#ffffff>X:</color>\n<color=#36ffff>https:/x.com/Genshin_7/status/2006576116681822586</color>"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "妖怪种类"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 2386,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 15
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "似狐的妖怪。在民话传说中，它们拥有奇特的智慧与悠远的记忆。狐族有着等级划分，其中最为强大的是「天狐」。比其低两个等级的是野狐，以人类为食。此外还有「地狐」。有传说在狐斋宫消失后，力量更强的「天狐」和「地狐」都化作石像等待她的回归，而这些狐狸则随着一族的灵脉变得稀薄，而不再开口，也失去了法力。\n食梦貘\n貘形妖怪，能以梦境为食。\n鬼族\n外形长着鬼角的巨人妖怪。一共分为两种鬼族：赤鬼与青鬼。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3053,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 15
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "生性乐天的妖怪，亦被称作狸。它们变化成其他物体，乃至于人类的能力。\n天狗\n有着羽翼的妖怪，栖息于山林之中。\n猫又\n有着两条尾巴的妖怪，真身是一只猫。\n付丧神\n由其他妖怪的力量影响而催生的物品之灵。\n「魇」妖怪\n寄生在人类噩梦里的妖怪，现已灭绝。\n化猫\n化身为少女人形的妖怪。\n貉\n能变形的妖怪。大人们会把关于大貉妖的传说当作恐怖故事讲给孩子们听，以防止他们在夜里独自外出。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3449,
        "name": "狐妖",
        "desc": "",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/07/20/47826599/76567cd13cfafe285fb206d4048e4565_8798895845584795438.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3448,
        "name": "独眼小僧",
        "desc": "",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/07/20/47826599/fc7e6d7d7171c2ceaedc2657a87ac54d_6476260827342998139.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3450,
        "name": "河童",
        "desc": "",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/07/20/47826599/8e15d77396d6a387b146a2cc7a65d735_5405953281948019337.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "其他妖怪。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "著名妖怪"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7,
        "name": "八重神子",
        "desc": "鸣神大社的宫司大人，兼任「八重堂」总编。艳丽动人的外表下藏着令人意想不到的聪慧与狡黠。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/05/22/327628065/fe99f0fadeeb003fe11d754ef4486e23_4303297213034238274.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "天狐，鸣神大社的宫司，隶属白辰一族，亦是",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7470,
        "name": "巴尔泽布",
        "desc": "<p>稻妻的雷神，又名雷电影。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/07/02/317661877/1fe5f96e70278401452680b896cae82e_2606347708841965507.png",
        "displayStyle": "text"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "的眷属。她是一位力量强大的妖怪。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7498,
        "name": "狐斋宫",
        "desc": "<p>出身于白辰一族的狐狸，被人们奉为仙狐。在五百年前的灾厄中逝世。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/05/31/317661877/0f08dee2a7798c318a8db9ebc84e13ad_5000316621151635289.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "出身于白辰一族的狐狸，被人们奉为仙狐。在五百年前的",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7089,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 20
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "中，她被深渊侵蚀，其记忆从污秽中化作",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 2541,
        "name": "花散里",
        "desc": "<p>鸣神大社巫女，身份成谜。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/04/13/317661877/f9a3c66c6d475fbb9efb2356d099a444_7730347167900024443.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "的形态。\n白辰\n一只狐狸，白辰一族的主母。\n有乐斋\n一位力量极强的狐狸，大妖狐。他能随意附身于人体，并且对文学很感兴趣。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7420,
        "name": "梦见月瑞希",
        "desc": "「秋沙钱汤」的股东，梦貘一族的心理诊疗师，致力于驱散噩梦，为人们带来安宁的心境。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2025/02/08/11662c12fb353d88bd2b20a2726c9f1c_8013472600677983943.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "一位才华出众的食梦貘，心理诊疗师，也是「秋沙钱汤」的股东。相较于其他的貘，她更能理解人们的情感。\n百日白白音\n柴葉紫\n食梦貘，「秋沙钱汤」的工作人员。\n久吕由命\n最后的「魇」妖怪，曾试图复活同类。他最终被瑞希阻止。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 2454,
        "name": "五百藏",
        "desc": "<p>大妖狸，被惟神晴之介封印在雕像中。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/07/03/317661877/5616b6b3139611441609112738d0b013_5895955992366996066.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "妖狸大王隠神五百藏，亦是隐神保生司正。他是狐斋宫的挚友与对手。当年五百藏与镇守之森的其他妖狸一同误将净化神樱所需的「镇物」当作普通梳子并偷走，被",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7501,
        "name": "惟神晴之介",
        "desc": "<p>五百多年前创造诀箓阴阳寮之人。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/04/13/317661877/534dcacd932867bcf1f0fe68f35a36f3_180637505436097742.png",
        "displayStyle": "text"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "封印在了石头中。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4516,
        "name": "「证城」",
        "desc": "<p>镇守之森的妖狸。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/07/04/317661877/9ef2e4597fa40ff3b14e6bc1daf88ac3_3062045513040405191.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 2448,
        "name": "「刑部小判」",
        "desc": "<p>镇守之森的妖狸。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/07/04/317661877/0caf81975a271a5b230198f54ecb39ef_4970412175525833217.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 2449,
        "name": "「吉法师」",
        "desc": "<p>镇守之森的小妖狸。五百藏想将「妖狸大王」和「保生司正」的责任交给他。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/07/04/317661877/49637fef6e2a6ffeedd93fafa7b3b215_5864861227652601426.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "镇守之森的小狸子。\n「金阁」\n「银阁」\n「铁之助」\n这些妖狸被御舆千代的一角残片中的「噩梦」所附身。五百年来，它们一直躲藏着，将所有人都视为敌人，直至从深渊的侵染中被净化。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 36,
        "name": "荒泷一斗",
        "desc": "活跃在稻妻城花见坂的「荒泷派」初代目头领。什么，从没听说过荒泷派？你是想找茬吗？",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/05/22/327628065/831b304c0992a329a48f133c1318a3a8_4924365661986227971.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "一只赤鬼和「荒泷派」的头领。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7500,
        "name": "御舆千代",
        "desc": "<p>雷电影麾下爱将，在坎瑞亚灾变后被「噩梦」侵蚀而陷入疯狂后被影亲手击败，从此不知所踪。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/04/13/317661877/6ea050aa0bf1c124840bdb386f992fb7_3410794273359677030.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "一只赤鬼，亦是雷电影的挚友。在灾厄期间，她被噩梦侵蚀，并向影发起了攻击，最终因此殒命。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7497,
        "name": "卓也",
        "desc": "<p>青鬼后人，因参与野伏众袭击，现已被逮捕。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/05/31/317661877/4f61fadba4cc305bc97370093905f98a_3680864538400381002.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "最后一个青鬼。\n赤穗百目鬼\n一位鬼族，盗贼，也是大盗，被称作清籁的不死之鬼。他参与了反抗幕府的叛乱。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3719,
        "name": "绮良良",
        "desc": "<p>稻妻快递公司「狛荷屋」的送货员，一只热爱自己工作、向往人类社会的「猫又」。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/05/23/47826599/d1699810632f8c3bc8c1e8c8beb8250f_2564441580954160240.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "一只猫又和「狛荷屋」的送货员。\n镰井显治\n一位顶尖的妖怪。在",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7428,
        "name": "三川花祭",
        "desc": "<p>三川花祭是由妖怪举办的庆典，聚在一起畅饮、欢笑、即兴演奏，让参与者尽兴。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/02/11/142453215/25f6b35d74acab77e108731cf61ede98_6622793241878011933.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 20
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "期间，他与一位凡人武士相遇，并结为挚友。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3451,
        "name": "羽生田千鹤",
        "desc": "<p>依物品而诞生的妖怪，在本体之外幻化出人类的外形，是一位「付丧神」。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/08/09/142453215/8c5b3611d8309efd5945e2cf8e327acc_2811811937742924851.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "一对羽子板的生灵和付丧神。在镰井以及那位武士一同在「秋津羽戏」游戏中，因镰井的力量而觉醒。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7499,
        "name": "笹百合",
        "desc": "<p>天狗族人，幕府军大将。两千年前在与大蛇奥罗巴斯的战争中阵亡。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/04/13/317661877/6532a7d73481ef732501064e283864c1_8428633474361457745.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "天狗族，幕府军的大将。两千年前，在与",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4908,
        "name": "奥罗巴斯",
        "desc": "<p>魔神战争的失败者，被雷神「无想的一刀」斩杀的巨蛇魔神。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/07/31/59155606/747288a2c90b1de20ed1f9e1b4938d72_493990636923865206.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "的内战中阵亡。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3,
