        "desc": "「天领奉行」的大将，杀伐果断，骁勇善战。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/05/22/327628065/e1306e693d2e305287a753411e638270_2251199649727903784.png",
